meta {
  name: Post Create Driver Vehicle Relation
  type: http
  seq: 9
}

post {
  url: {{baseUrl}}/driver/vehicle
  body: json
  auth: bearer
}

body:json {
  {
    "driver_id": "830b1ba4-3e90-28d4-1f0b-aadcd406090f",
    "vehicle_id": "6c1ff866-ce85-fa03-21ce-b30905b43b1a",
    "relation_note": "Driver weekday"
  }
}

auth:bearer {
  token: {{token}}
}

docs {
  # Post Create Driver Vehicle Relation

  This request is used to create a driver - vehicle relation by using given `vehicle_id`, `driver_id`, and `relation_note`. This request interacts with the MySQL database, has a protected routes, broadcast message with Telegram, and audited activity (history).

  ## Responses

  **201 — driver relation created**
```json
  {
    "status": "success",
    "message": "driver assigned"
  }
```

  **400 — driver failed to validated**
```json
  {
    "status": "failed",
    "message": "[failed validation message]"
  }
```

  **401 — protected route need to include sign in token as authorization bearer**
```json
  {
    "status": "failed",
    "message": "you need to include the authorization token from login"
  }
```

  **500 — Internal Server Error**
```json
  {
    "status": "error",
    "message": "something wrong. please contact admin"
  }
```
}